# Files that must never reach the CDN.
#
# Nothing here is referenced by index.html, site.css or site.js — verified by
# scanning every src/href/url() in the project. Together they are 5.1 MB of the
# 8.2 MB folder, so excluding them roughly halves the deploy.
#
# If you ever wire one of these back into a page, delete its line here first or
# it will 404 in production while working perfectly on your machine.

# macOS noise
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store

# Superseded project artwork (kept locally in case you want it back)
assets/bugtracker-cover.png
assets/ring-sizer.png

# Radius screenshots — the card shows the live Figma prototype instead
# (radius-cover.png is used by the Radius case study, so it must ship)
assets/radius-live-room.png
assets/radius-notifications.png
assets/radius-profile.png
assets/radius-referrals.png
assets/radius-room-type.png
assets/radius-rooms.png

# Font source. The browser only ever loads the woff2/woff pair.
assets/fonts/SharpGrotesk-Book20.otf
assets/fonts/README.txt

# Notes for you, not for visitors
README.md
